# Sword of the Meek is already on Birds of Paradise and Skullclamp is not when Thorin enters (turn 5), and both are targeted. The Sword
# stays put (CR 701.3b) but Skullclamp becomes attached, which is enough: the Birds, now 0/1 +1/+2 +1/-1 = 2/2, deal 2 damage (their
# power, not Thorin's 3) to Bot2's Ulvenwald Oddity, which survives with 2 damage.

